{"id":"vod_bf_153055","vodId":"153055","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"擅长逃跑的殿下 第二季","name_cn":"擅长逃跑的殿下 第二季","date":"2026-01-01","year":"2026","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"更新至第12集","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20260718-1/bcfa7ac2c19c206f777875431353641a.webp"},"summary":"公元1333年，为武士统治日本奠定基石的镰仓幕府，因其所信任的幕臣——足利尊氏的谋反而宣告灭亡。 失去了一切、被推入绝望深渊的幕府正统继承人——北条时行，在自称为神的神官——诹访赖重的手中引导下，逃离了化为一片火海的镰仓……。 在逃亡抵达的诹访之地，时行与值得信赖的伙伴结成了「逃少党」，并借由「逃跑」与「活下去」来克服重重苦难，逐渐磨练出作为率领大军之将领的实力。 另一方面，在京都的尊氏其权力正稳步扩张，而在镰仓，以尊氏之弟——直义为首的新统治也正大受欢迎。 在时代更迭的巨大浪潮中，时行夺回天下的这场捉迷藏，其结局将会走向何方——。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日韩动漫"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-10-02 23:43:10","episodeCount":12,"playable":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://bfeng11.com/video/shanchangtaopaodedianxiadierji/fb253c935a09/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://bfeng11.com/video/shanchangtaopaodedianxiadierji/24d4e74f3ad0/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://bfeng11.com/video/shanchangtaopaodedianxiadierji/f8f3ee003f2a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://bfeng11.com/video/shanchangtaopaodedianxiadierji/3828abd855af/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://bfeng11.com/video/shanchangtaopaodedianxiadierji/5f1f017f08f2/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://fengbao12.com/video/shanchangtaopaodedianxiadierji/f0fa58e049f2/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://fengbao12.com/video/shanchangtaopaodedianxiadierji/a2657713349f/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://fengbao12.com/video/shanchangtaopaodedianxiadierji/38d97af54c67/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://fengbao12.com/video/shanchangtaopaodedianxiadierji/569ed2fc3c63/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://fengbao12.com/video/shanchangtaopaodedianxiadierji/b9642509428c/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://fengbao12.com/video/shanchangtaopaodedianxiadierji/b729a54613d7/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://fen